%%{init: {
  'theme': 'neutral',
  'themeVariables': {

  }
}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    title 3. Link Quality Assessment and Selection
    
    participant Agent as SparkAgent
    participant Flow as FlowControl
    participant WiFi as WifiAdapter
    participant LAN as LanAdapter
    participant Mobile as MobileAdapter
    participant Sender
    participant Monitor as MonitorAdapter
    participant Manager as SparkManager
    
    Note over Agent: Scheduled Link Monitoring (every 30s)
    Agent->>Flow: Update link qualities
    
    par WiFi Assessment
        Flow->>WiFi: Get link quality
        WiFi->>WiFi: Check availability (ping test)
        WiFi->>WiFi: Measure bandwidth
        WiFi->>WiFi: Measure latency
        WiFi->>WiFi: Calculate reliability score
        WiFi-->>Flow: WiFi quality metrics
    and LAN Assessment
        Flow->>LAN: Get link quality
        LAN->>LAN: Check availability (socket test)
        LAN->>LAN: Measure bandwidth
        LAN->>LAN: Measure latency
        LAN->>LAN: Calculate reliability score
        LAN-->>Flow: LAN quality metrics
    and Mobile Assessment
        Flow->>Mobile: Get link quality
        Mobile->>Mobile: Check availability (HTTP test)
        Mobile->>Mobile: Measure bandwidth
        Mobile->>Mobile: Measure latency
        Mobile->>Mobile: Calculate reliability score
        Mobile-->>Flow: Mobile quality metrics
    end
    
    Note over Flow: Link Selection Algorithm
    Flow->>Flow: Calculate composite scores
    Note over Flow: Score = (bandwidth×0.4) + ((1000-latency)×0.3) + (reliability×100×0.3)<br/>Mode=Slow (on wifi) / Fast (on mobile)
    Flow->>Flow: Select highest scoring available link

    %%Note over Flow: Mode selection Algorithm
    %%Flow->>Flow: Check mobile availability and letancy
    %%Note over Flow: Mode = is good mobile available -> Continuous<br/>is slow mobile or wifi only -> Interval
    
    rect rgb(255, 255, 200)
        alt Link Changed
            Flow->>Sender: Update selected link and mode
            Note over Flow: Log link change decision
        else Same Link
            Note over Flow: Continue with current link
        end
    end
    
    Note over Monitor: Report to Manager
    Monitor->>Manager: POST /api/monitoring
    Note over Monitor: Send link qualities + system metrics
    Manager-->>Monitor: 200 OK
    
    rect rgb(200, 200, 255)
        Note over Flow: Link quality data available for scheduler decisions
    end